# Product like: stand-out heart + click delight (learned 2026-09-25)

## Shipped (2026-09-25)

- Unliked: rose outline / rose pill (not gray). Compact heart `w-5`.
- On successful like only: scale pop + fill + count bounce; PDP micro heart burst.
- `prefers-reduced-motion`: no pop/burst.
- Unlike: no delight animation.

## Visibility (customer eye)

| Idea | Effect | Fit for SELPIC |
|------|--------|----------------|
| **Always soft-red outline** (not gray) before like | Reads as “like” not “settings” | **Do** |
| **Slightly larger** compact heart (`w-5`) + pink/rose pill tint | Pops on photo without fighting NEW badges | **Do** |
| Soft pulse / glow idle on PDP only | Draws eye once | Optional, keep subtle |
| Neon / rainbow / huge floating heart always on | Noise vs merch badges | **Avoid** |

Liked state: filled `red-500` / rose — keep. Unliked: `text-rose-500` stroke, never gray/black.

## Click delight (희열) — research summary

Industry pattern (IG / Shopify wishlist / TikTok): **short feedback loop** on successful like only (not unlike).

| Effect | Delight | Cost / risk |
|--------|---------|-------------|
| **A. Scale pop** `scale 1 → 1.35 → 1` ~200–300ms | Instant “it registered” | Low — CSS only — **ship first** |
| **B. Fill morph** outline → solid mid-pop | Satisfying commit | Low — with A |
| **C. Micro burst** 4–6 tiny hearts / dots fly out | High joy | Medium — CSS/span, no new lib |
| **D. Confetti / canvas party** | Overkill on every SKU card | High noise / perf — **avoid** on listings |
| **E. Count +1 bounce** | Reinforces social proof | Low — pair with A |
| **F. Sound / strong haptic** | Polarizing; a11y | Skip unless owner asks |
| **`prefers-reduced-motion`** | Respect accessibility | **Required** if any motion |

**Recommended package:** A + B + E on PDP and cards; optional light C on **PDP only**. Fire animation **after** successful POST (or optimistic with rollback) so failed likes don’t fake joy.

## Do not

- Animate on every card hover forever (exhausting)
- Confetti on listing grids (LCP / clutter)
- Gray “default icon” color for unliked heart
- Tie delight to admin rating stars
